\nこれで最後になると思いますね。\nたくさんのエロいイラストを描いてくれて、本当にありがとうございました！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@irodori_akari/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2e7de725/uploads/origins/09ddca46-1cae-42de-bbf0-2a326d455d72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=67f2e8b59765a1e04796113a670a0961", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2e7de725/uploads/origins/09ddca46-1cae-42de-bbf0-2a326d455d72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=67f2e8b59765a1e04796113a670a0961, https://si.imgix.net/2e7de725/uploads/origins/09ddca46-1cae-42de-bbf0-2a326d455d72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7210f62b87150bdcfdd975c8aeeeadfe 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2e7de725/uploads/origins/09ddca46-1cae-42de-bbf0-2a326d455d72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9ca09eb333f5d3297b16f7c0c6058f66 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "こんにちは！\n\n前回のイラストはすごかったですね！続きを依頼してもよろしいですか？\n設定は\n和式のトイレでうんちに埋もれた小人を見下ろして、流しハンドルを踏みかけて脅すハルヒでお願いします！小人は慌てて脱出しようとしているけど、埋もれすぎて出られない感じです。\n姿勢の参考画像は\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/npm3gz.png\n\nhello!\n\nthat last set of pictures was amazing! Can I commission your for a continuation of these?\nIt would be Haruhi looking down on the tiny who's buried in shit in the japanese-style toilet and threatening them by putting their foot on the flushing handle. The tiny would be freaking out and trying to get away but they're so buried in the shit that they can't get out. \nHere's a reference image for the pose. \nhttps://files.catbox.moe/npm3gz.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@irodori_akari/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6d84ccfe/uploads/origins/791c0cd6-5bcf-4c57-a71d-037dd89ed2bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3b3495b387268b9be6fff74e527177c4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6d84ccfe/uploads/origins/791c0cd6-5bcf-4c57